  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesTotalNumberOfSharesEtc contextRef="FilingDateInstant_OrdinaryShareMember">完全議決権株式であり、株主としての権利内容に何ら限定のない当社における標準となる株式であります。なお、単元株式数は100株であります。</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesTotalNumberOfSharesEtc>
  <jpcrp_cor:DetailsOfEmployeeShareOptionProgramTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head4" style="padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;① 【ストックオプション制度の内容】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:0pt;"&gt;　会社法に基づき発行した新株予約権は、次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;第１回新株予約権&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:0pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:482.1pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:170.1pt;min-width:170.1pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:312pt;min-width:312pt;"/&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:22.7pt;min-height:22.7pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;決議年月日&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;2016年４月30日&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
