&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;新発行株式数×１株当たり払込金額&lt;/p&gt;
